      en: ["The island was inscribed as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1981.", "There are 32 carved totem poles still standing in their original positions.", "The village was abandoned around 1885 following a smallpox epidemic.", "The Haida people lived at this site for at least 2,000 years.", "The poles are carved from large Western Red Cedar trees.", "The site is part of the Gwaii Haanas National Park Reserve."],
